{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04545","headline":"奉和圣制义成校猎喜雪应制 · 张说","name":"奉和圣制义成校猎喜雪应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文教资武功，郊畋阅邦政。\n不知仁育久，徒看禽兽盛。\n夜霰氛埃灭，朝日山川净。\n绰仗飞走繁，抨弦筋角劲。\n帝射参神道，龙驰合人性。\n五豝连一发，百中皆先命。\n勇爵均万夫，雄图罗七圣。\n星爲吉符老，雪作丰年庆。\n喜听行猎诗，威神入军令。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04545.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04545","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}